    "updated_at": "2026-07-11T18:45:43Z",
    "body": "```python\r\nstate = SCIState(\r\n    amplitudes=vec.reshape(len(strs_a), len(strs_b)),\r\n    ci_strs_a=ints_a,\r\n    ci_strs_b=ints_a,\r\n    norb=norb,\r\n    nelec=nelec,\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\r\n`ci_strs_b=ints_a` should be `ci_strs_b=ints_b`\r\n\r\nAlso, Kushagra Agarwal spotted an issue with vector ordering mismatch between SQD addon and Fulqrum. Fulqrum uses a beta outer x alpha inner odering. \r\n\r\nThe corrected block is (# SQD ordering and Fulqrum ordering are transpose of each other. ascontiguousarray() is needed for matching C contiguous ordering inside PySCF.):\r\n\r\n```python\r\nstate = SCIState(\r\n    amplitudes=np.ascontiguousarray(vec.reshape(len(strs_b), len(strs_a)).T),\r\n    ci_strs_a=ints_a,\r\n    ci_strs_b=ints_b,\r\n    norb=norb,\r\n    nelec=nelec,\r\n)\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
