    "created_at": "2026-07-11T18:50:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-11T18:50:57Z",
    "body": "Hi, thanks @ashsaki. The mismatch can be verified with the following script.\r\n``` import itertools, fulqrum as fq, numpy as np\r\nstrs_a, strs_b = ['00','01','10'], ['0','1']\r\nS = fq.Subspace([strs_a, strs_b])\r\nvec = np.arange(len(S), dtype=float)\r\nwrong = vec.reshape(len(strs_a), len(strs_b))\r\nright = vec.reshape(len(strs_b), len(strs_a)).T\r\n# Compare to Fulqrum order: product(beta, alpha) -> b+a\r\nfor b in strs_b:\r\n    for a in strs_a:\r\n        idx = S.get_bitstring_index(b + a)\r\n        ia, ib = strs_a.index(a), strs_b.index(b)\r\n        assert right[ia, ib] == vec[idx]\r\n        # wrong[ia, ib] == vec[idx] fails for 4/6 elements\r\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
