    "created_at": "2026-07-22T18:38:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-22T19:22:37Z",
    "body": "> Note that using `scipy.sparse.linalg.eigsh` is not optimal here because of issues with the oversubscription of threads between openmp (fulqrum) and openblas. It is best to use PRIMME: https://github.com/primme/primme\r\n\r\nOn my machine, setting the environment variable `OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1` seems to fix that issue. It reduced the time for diagonalization in this example by half.\r\n\r\nBut I've still added a section using PRIMME because the ability to swap solvers is a good feature of fulqrum.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
